senses.gloss:
1. रुप् (cf. √ लुप्) cl. 4. P. (Dhātup. xxvi, 125) रु॑प्यति (pf. रुरोप aor. अरुपत् &c. Gr.), to suffer violent or racking pain (in the abdomen), TBr.; Kāṭh.;
to violate, confound, disturb, Dhātup. :
Caus. रोपयति (aor. अरूरुपत्), to cause acute or violent pain, AV.;
to break off, TBr.

रूप् (prob. Nom. fr. रूप) cl. 10. P. (Dhātup. xxxv, 79) रूपयति, to form, figure, represent (esp. on the stage), exhibit by gesture, act, feign, Hariv.; Kāv.; BhP. &c.;
to view, inspect, contemplate, Kir. viii, 26; Pāṇ. iii, 1, 25, Sch.;
 (Ā. ˚यते) to show one's self, appear, Vop.
